    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "デアリングハートとの出会いから数日……\n気がつけば、彼女の動向を目で追うようになっていた。",
            "enText": "A few days after meeting Daring Heart…… \nBefore I realized it, I would find myself following her with my eyes.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -4177593617656110171,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人C",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend C",
            "jpText": "ハートってば、またひとりランチしてるー！\n……わわっ！　食べる量、前より増えてない……！？",
            "enText": "Geez, Heart, you're eating by yourself again! \n……Wawah! Aren't you eating more than before……!?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 215,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 145,
                    "pathId": 2296326457429157872
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": -6520718731612718385
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8797292800382418664,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフ、今はバルクアップ――増量期間中なの。\n模擬レースに向けて、この体を完璧に仕上げるために、ね。",
            "enText": "Fufu, now I'm bulking up――building my strength. For the next \nmock race, I need to get this body in to perfect shape.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 312,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": -7448694299004345851
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 67,
                    "pathId": 5255833392356248735
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9018089686391124368,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人D",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend D",
            "jpText": "模擬レースって……あのラインクラフトたちとの！\n超強いって聞いたよ～。でも、ハートなら余裕でしょ♪",
            "enText": "Mock race……that one with Rhein Kraft! \nI heard she was strong～. But for Heart it's a piece of cake♪",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 326,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": -1184528193181638083
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -2661668128455632976
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6520135183739383563,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "いいえ。クラフトも、シーザリオもメサイアも。\n素晴らしい素質を持ってるわ。決して……一筋縄ではいかない相手。",
            "enText": "No. Kraft, Cesario, and Messiah. They have great potential. \nI absolutely……can't take them lightly.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 310,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（……その通りだ）",
                    "enText": "(……That's right.)",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5102343903722549625
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -3510959691447494822
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8978532589898886930,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ラインクラフト、シーザリオ、エアメサイア――\nデアリングハートと同じティアラ路線志望の、強力なウマ娘たち。",
            "enText": "Rhein Kraft, Cesario, and Air Messiah――Strong Uma Musume that \nare competing against Daring Heart in the Tiara rotation.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 2242231962913553020
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 4116513092356587304
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
