            "pathId": -2163805312186211259,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "もちろん、デアリングハートにも才能はある。\nそれでも、彼女たちに一歩及ばない部分があるとすれば――",
            "enText": "Of course, Daring Heart has potential too. But still, \nif there was one thing where she was a step behind, it would be――",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -956936831369373207
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 97,
                    "pathId": 3380295860441850812
