        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "お皿に盛られている、華奢な体には多すぎる食事。\n彼女はそれを、気合いで胃に収めようとしているようだった。",
            "enText": "The food was piled up on her plate, much more than \nsomeone of her slender frame would normally consume. \nIt looked like she was trying to force it all down.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（全ては……ライバルたちに勝つために）",
                    "enText": "(All this……to beat her rivals)",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 70,
                    "pathId": -61761799589581199
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -1914928856211883672
