            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "また会いたいと思ってたのよ！\nこの後、一緒に過ごさない？　あなたに、頼みたいことがあるの♪",
            "enText": "I was just thinking that I wanted to see you again! After this, how \nabout spending some time together? I'd like your help with something♪",
