        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "『何か気づいたことがあったら伝えてほしい』――\nそう言われて、トレーニングを見守ることになった。",
            "enText": "『If you notice anything, please let me know』―― \nAfter she said that, I was now watching over her training.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
