            "pathId": 1846323923830723270,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女が手にしているウエイトは、想像以上の重さだった。\nその体躯では考えられないほどの負荷をかけている。",
            "enText": "The weights she was using were heavier than I \nexpected. Considering her physique, it seemed like \nshe was putting considerable strain on herself.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（大丈夫なのか……？）",
                    "enText": "(Is this really okay……?)",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（大丈夫なのかな……？）",
                    "enText": "(Is this really okay……?)",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
