        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "フォームもわずかに崩れ始め、これでは満足な効果は得られない。\nそれどころか、ケガのリスクまである。見かねて声をかける。",
            "enText": "Her form was starting to crumble. At this rate, \nthe results would be unsatisfactory. Aside from \nthat, there was the risk of injury. I spoke up.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そろそろ、休憩を挟もう",
                    "enText": "It's about time for a break",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 145,
                    "pathId": -4904587709393338152
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
