            "pathId": -8093422095590132693,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "…………わかったわ。\n少し、気を張っていたみたい……指摘してくれて、ありがとね。",
            "enText": "…………I understand. Maybe I'm just a little on \nedge right now……Thanks for letting me know.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 376,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 4275565845770550935
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 2897262714786583629
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -9041838925864543185
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5509391082459282349,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "あなた、冷静に状況を見る目を持ってる――\nフフ、ちゃんと優秀なトレーナーだったのね。……そうだ、担当は？",
            "enText": "You're pretty good at judging the situation rationally―― \nFufu, you're quite the outstanding trainer, aren't you? \n……That's right, what about your trainee?",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 402,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "まだ、全然決まっていないんだ",
                    "enText": "I haven't decided yet",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
