            "pathId": -8708880760856780308,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そうなの？　でも……そう、ちょっと意外。\nあなたもこれからなのね。",
            "enText": "Is that right? But……that's kind of unexpected. \nSo you're just getting started too, huh?",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 265,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "これから？",
                    "enText": "Started?",
                    "nextBlock": 26
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 148,
                    "pathId": -6433333596975363036
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6135580829850549869
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2625509328573649116,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そうよ……あなたのトレーナー生活も、私のクイーンへの道も、\n全部これから。ああ……とってもワクワクするわね！",
            "enText": "That's right……your Trainer life, and my road to being Queen, \nit all starts now. Ohhh……it's kind of exciting, don't you think!?",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 387,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クイーン……そうか、君は――",
                    "enText": "Queen……I see, that's your――",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "クイーン……そうか、貴方は――",
                    "enText": "Queen……I see, that's your――",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": -4960907121167984903
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 22,
                    "pathId": 381030935487154360
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1713161398668583114,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ええ、私が目指すのは、トリプルティアラよ。",
            "enText": "Yes, my aim is the Triple Tiara.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 175,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": -7085450928490384502
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7858324178680947613,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "日本の、トリプルティアラのレースを観て……\n心に固く誓ったの。私も、その花冠を戴いてみせるって！",
            "enText": "Watching Japan's Triple Tiara races…… \nI made a firm vow. That I too would wear that floral crown!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": -8933399358251870179
                },
                {
