        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "トリプルティアラ――クラシック級で『桜花賞』『オークス』\n『秋華賞』3つのレースを制した者に与えられる称号だ。",
            "enText": "The Triple Tiara――a title bestowed upon one who \nobtained victory in three specific Classic-grade \nraces. The 『Oka Sho』, 『Oaks』, and 『Shuka Sho』",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": 4866070038326089321
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 224,
                    "pathId": 2129688405484807979
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -587450423505274898,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……もうすぐ私、ティアラ路線志望の同期と模擬レースを走るの。\n宿命のライバルが揃う、初舞台よ。――だからこそ。",
            "enText": "……Soon I'll be running a mock race with some of the \ngirls that will also be competing for the Tiara. The \nfirst time on stage with my fated rivals. ――Which is why――",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 380,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 393,
                    "pathId": 4558161392244291309
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 319,
                    "pathId": 614662687151568663
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3645127119456828422,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "1秒でも長くトレーニングをして、1gでも多く筋肉をつける。\n食事も、生活も、すべてを勝利のために捧げてみせるわ！",
            "enText": "Being able to train for even a second longer, \nbeing able to lift even one more gram. Nutrition, \nlifestyle, all of it for the sake of victory!",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 373,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -3775452540991472657
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 4349392543842409568
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 316,
                    "pathId": 6835476211435743719
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3087390867704557908,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そして必ず、私がトリプルティアラのクイーンになるのよ――！",
            "enText": "And then, without fail, I will become a Triple Tiara Queen――!",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 168,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -7689841129558450648
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2153701556389349159
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -409668212227513767,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女が語るのは、夢ではなく……やがて来る、未来の話なのだ。\n――強い気迫に、激しく心が揺さぶられた。",
            "enText": "She spoke of it, not like a dream……but as if it were the future. \n――I was deeply moved by her strong determination.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": 5330624204323910481
