            "pathId": 1578181852373450892,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "さ、キリもいいし、ここまでにしましょうか。\nあなた聞き上手だから……つい熱くなっちゃった！",
            "enText": "Alright, this seems like a good stopping point, \nlet's call it a day. You're quite a good listener…… \nSo I ended up getting a little carried away!",
