            "pathId": -6003386553047505103,
            "blockIdx": 36
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "一切、余白のないスケジュールだった。\n彼女は、極限まで隙間を削り――つまり身も削っている。",
            "enText": "It was a schedule with no breaks at all. She filled absolutely \nevery minute――like this, she would only be wearing herself down.",
            "nextBlock": 38,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（睡眠時間さえ、文献の読破に充てて……）",
                    "enText": "(Even cutting sleep for research……)",
                    "nextBlock": 38
