        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ああ……スケジュールのこと？　フフッ、あなたって心配性なのね。\nでも大丈夫。私、とってもタフだから♪",
            "enText": "Aaah……about my schedule? Fufuu, you're quite the worrywart, huh. \nBut it's fine. I'm really tough, after all♪",
            "nextBlock": 40,
            "origClipLength": 369,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "だけど……っ！",
