        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "――勝つためには。誰よりも前に行きたければ、誰よりも努力する。\n絶えず、折れず――這いつくばってでも、前へ進むの。",
            "enText": "――For the sake of victory. To go further than anyone, I need \nto work harder than anyone. Without stopping, without stumbling―― \nEven if I have to crawl, I will keep moving forward.",
            "nextBlock": 41,
            "origClipLength": 396,
