            "pathId": 5995321687076101365,
            "blockIdx": 40
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "不利だとか、無茶だとか、そんなの全部ねじ伏せる。\n“Daring Heart”を磨き上げて、勝利をつかみ取る！",
            "enText": "Even if it's from a disadvantage, or is reckless――I'll overcome \nit all. This \"Daring Heart\" will carry through to victory!",
