            "pathId": -7866591294702236257,
            "blockIdx": 42
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "あなたはきっと、いいトレーナーになるわ。\nだってこんなにも優しいもの。私には……優しすぎるくらい。",
            "enText": "I'm sure you'll become a great trainer. You're this \nkind after all. Maybe……a little too kind to me.",
