            "blockIdx": 43
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "固く、鋭く、研ぎ澄まされた信念が、\n彼女を前へ前へと駆り立てていく。",
            "enText": "That firm, unwavering, and directed \nconviction would drive her ever forward.",
