            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -1293391996040399221,
            "blockIdx": 44
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は強い。心も、眼差しも、信念も。\nこれほど強いウマ娘に……自分の力など、不要かもしれない。",
            "enText": "She is strong. In her heart, her gaze, and her \nconviction. For an Uma Musume that was this \nstrong……perhaps someone like me was unnecessary.",
